  "description": "A powerful .NET 10 library to generate Excel files from IEnumerable collections using ClosedXML. Features include fluent configuration API, multiple aggregation types (Sum, Average, Min, Max, Count), conditional formatting, multi-sheet support, freeze panes, and customizable headers. Built with C# 14.",
