  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0 - Major Release: Introduced fluent configuration API with advanced features. New: Multiple aggregation types (Sum, Average, Min, Max, Count), conditional formatting (color scales, data bars, highlighting), multi-sheet workbooks, freeze panes. Backward compatible with V2.x - all existing code continues to work. Enhanced API with ExcelConfiguration<T> builder pattern and ExcelWorkbookBuilder for complex scenarios.",
